<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls against dollar, sterling.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls against dollar, sterling.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling depreciated slightly on Wednesday against both the dollar and sterling, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The Bank of Tanzania said the dollar was trading at commercial mean rate of 594.3069 versus 593.9703 on Tuesday and at 994.3973 against the pound from 992.5274.</p>
</text>
